奖励。 在山西省吕梁市，自2025年1月1日起，在吕梁市登记结婚（双方均为初次登记）且女方年龄在35周岁及以下的夫妇，给予1500元的奖励。结婚奖励资金在结婚登记窗口以现金装红包的形式现场发放。 此外，还有部分地方发放价值不等的礼包。西安交通大学人口与发展研究所教授姜全保此前对第一财经分析，结婚奖励进一步释放了鼓励适龄婚育的积极信号，同时也是降低结婚、生育、养育、教育等婚育成本的一个体现，降低结婚、生育、养育、教育等成本是一个系统的工程，奖励结婚也是将鼓励支持措施进一步往前延伸。多地宣布发钱奖励结婚"},"attached_info":"CkkIuKj3srzYxr1QEAMaCTExNDY4ODk1MyCrt7HABjAAOGNAB3ITMTg5OTQzNDAzMzU2MzI2MzQ1MngAqgEJYmlsbGJvYXJk0gEA","detail_text":"98 万热度","trend":0,"debut":true,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://picx.zhimg.com/80/v2-02a8f9eddd0b9354c0a961ad8db3a339_1440w.png"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"8_1745655771.703502","card_id":"Q_1899444973750969848","card_label":{"type":"new","icon":"https://pic2.zhimg.com/80/v2-a4b0b52b561281109c51e4957cb20130_1440w.png","night_icon":"https://pic3.zhimg.com/80/v2-10ef6526c602e55a8c606e46aa0cc586_1440w.png"},"target":{"id":1899444973750969900,"title":"如何评价《崩坏：星穹铁道》二周年特别动画：「不虚此行」？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1899444973750969848","type":"question","created":1745642971,"answer_count":26,"follower_count":35,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":"","url":"","name":"用户","headline":"","avatar_url":"https://pica.zhimg.com/aadd7b895_s.jpg"},"bound_topic_ids":[166361,781978],"comment_count":0,"is_following":false,"excerpt":""},"attached_info":"CkkIuKj3srzYxr1QEAMaCTExNDY4OTQ5NSDby7HABjAAOCNACHITMTg5OTQ0NDk3Mzc1MDk2OTg0OHgAqgEJYmlsbGJvYXJk0gEA","detail_text":"98 万热度","trend":0,"debut":true,"children":[{"type":"answer","thumbnail":"https://pic1.zhimg.com/80/v2-df1c9898ebac7ad6cbb09713c465f0cb_1440w.webp?source=1def8aca"}]},{"type":"hot_list_feed","style_type":"1","id":"9_1745655771.703771","card_id":"Q_1897692496974291832","target":{"id":1897692496974291700,"title":"普惠托育机构 100 个托位只招到 17 个娃，为什么普惠了家长却「不敢托」？入托难的痛点到底是啥？","url":"https://api.zhihu.com/questions/1897692496974291832","type":"question","created":1745225148,"answer_count":41,"follower_count":79,"author":{"type":"people","user_type":"people","id":"0","url_token":""